              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda gaygabalak maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, sea museasooda fuga Lawi mida bugusta maheemajeega sean; aba gisijipta maheemajeega, nih gichea gabalakta giliwas sih aba heeda mida nea ghamiinda beendeerajeanda nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.17",
