            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meatkweeda biyeara gaygwanda beendeerajeanda ea maheemajeanda Efraimu ea lugoadaanyi; nea siida haw aba orjooga Efraimu ea Elishama orjeeda Amihudi, ",
          "type": "text",
