              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "buuneeda siyiida aba maheemajeanda Efraimu buuneeda ea sagalamnyooji bughala sis ea fih bughala. Ak ea fuga jea gamaseaw bea samwagu.",
          "type": "text",
