              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meatkweeda duukusa wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa gaygwanda beendeerajeanda maheemajeanda Dani ea lugweega nyaawa; nea siida haw aba orjooga Dani ea Ahieseri orjeeda Amishadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
