          "text": "Suh fuga siyiida was fuga Israeli aba gidabeada gealga ghweaniga nyaawa; fuga sean siyiida aba maheemajeanda ea lugweega nyaawa, buuneeda ea sagalamnyooji bughalaji lah ea samwagu ea bughalaji muut ea haradam ea damanamughuush. ",
